diff --git a/docs/utils.rst b/docs/utils.rst
index 995c171..b639cd8 100644
--- a/docs/utils.rst
+++ b/docs/utils.rst
@@ -217,6 +217,9 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+Pass ``handle_exit_codes`` to handle selected editor exit codes. A matching
+handler runs once; an unmatched nonzero exit retains the normal editing error.
+
 
 Launching Applications
